+
+// Access to the SD card over USB MIDI SysEx, with the protocol of community firmware 1.3 ("smSysex"), so that browser
+// apps like DEx (file browser) and deluge-editor (live load and save) work. Ported from 1.3 storage/smsysex.cpp.
